[00:00.00] 作词 : Jasmine Webb/Lotus Juice
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 喜多條敦志
[00:02.00] 编曲 : 喜多條敦志
[00:21.18] Time to shine and I'm down to ride (大放异彩的时刻到了，我已经准备好)
[00:23.51] I'm gonna drive until the break of dawn, wilding out (驶向破晓，狂野不羁)
[00:25.91] I'm on a mission grinding out (我将把一切视作磨练)
[00:27.20] Whatever it is I gotta do (无论即将有怎样的经历，我都将继续)
[00:28.54] Riding out until the day I meet you, I'm riding out (放开跑，直到遇见你之前 我放开跑)
[00:31.21] I look up in the sky (sky) (仰望天空)
[00:32.75] Asking lotta why (why) (我有许多疑惑)
[00:34.00] But never let it phase me, I'm keeping good vibes (但它们不会影响我的好心情)
[00:36.20] When I'm on the road, I watch out for all surprises (一路上我期待着种种邂逅)
[00:38.42] What it provides us (它们带给我们的)
[00:39.67] Good and bad but nothing unties us (喜和忧，但不会就此别过)
[00:41.22] Another wander in the night (又一次漫步于夜色中)
[00:43.96] Let me paint the view (描绘这风景)
[00:46.23] Colour a town with my light (用我的光，点亮这里的色彩)
[00:49.90] For every moment shared with you (为了与你分享的每一刻)
[00:51.49] Not out in the day (虽已不在白昼)
[00:53.91] But never fully gone (但也并未消逝)
[00:56.37] Going to be back again (总会回归)
[00:59.98] Until the coming of a dawn (在曙光降临的时刻)
[01:01.70] (HEY)For all the days ahead of us put your hands up (（嘿）为了我们未来的日子，举起你的双手)
[01:04.90] Wave 'em side to side for good luck ah (纵情挥舞，祝你好运)
[01:07.11] (HEY)For all the nights like this, put your hands up (（嘿）为了所有像这样的夜晚，举起你的双手)
[01:09.80] Love the moment even from dusk yup (热爱此刻，始于黄昏)
[01:11.90] (HEY)You always got my back, and of course I got your back (（嘿） 你总是我的后盾，所以我也会支持你)
[01:15.20] Don't you worry about that now (现在，别担心)
[01:17.27] (HEY)It's been a good day, good night (（嘿）真是美好的一天，美好的夜晚)
[01:19.66] It's gonna be a good day, good night (这将是美好的一天，美好的夜晚)
[01:41.80] When two hands meet at zenith (我们的双手在空中交错)
[01:44.64] Nothing comes between us (没有什么能够阻挡我们)
[01:46.80] Dancing like ballerinas (像芭蕾舞者一样)
[01:49.17] Under the moon light all night long (在月光下翩翩起舞)
[01:52.25] How these plain and simple scenes (那些平淡无奇的景色)
[01:54.43] Get painted so vividly by you... (被你描绘得如此生动)
[01:59.29] I just want to stay with you (我只想和你在一起)
[02:01.96] Around the world I slowly dance (在世界里轻柔地摇曳)
[02:04.68] Whenever our eyes meet (我们目光交汇时)
[02:06.98] You know you leave me in a trance (你知道，你让我恍惚)
[02:10.75] It means everything to me (对我而言，这就是一切)
[02:12.48] Looking down below (俯瞰风景)
[02:14.76] The one I seek to find (我寻觅的那个人)
[02:17.11] No matter where you might go (无论你将去往何方)
[02:20.70] Remember you'll be on my mind (记住，你永在我心)
[02:22.87] (HEY)Always watching over me somehow you make me feel invincible (（嘿）你的守望，令我所向披靡)
[02:26.28] Power to my soul, yup (给予我的灵魂以力量)
[02:27.89] (HEY)I'm at ease with things that used to bother me (（嘿）过去我的那些烦恼，现在都可以坦然面对)
[02:30.74] Cuz your existence just lights me up yup (因为你的光照亮了我)
[02:32.84] (HEY)You always got my back, and of course I got your back (（嘿）你总是我的后盾，所以我也会支持你)
[02:36.00] Don't you worry about that now (所以现在，不用再担心了)
[02:37.95] (HEY)It's been a good day, good night (（嘿）真是美好的一天，美好的夜晚)
[02:40.47] It's gonna be a good day, good night (这将是美好的一天，美好的夜晚)
[02:42.43] Within the inner heart I plead (我心中仍抱有期望)
[02:44.99] For you to talk to me (或许能再听你和我讲讲)
[02:47.38] I want to hear all the good and bad (我想再听听所有的那些好的，那些不好的)
[02:50.20] The new stories you have (那些你新的故事)
[02:52.54] As I drift across the sky (当我飘散在天空)
[02:55.19] The hour hand turns high (当时针高高转动)
[02:57.29] So goodnight (该说晚安了)
[02:59.92] Let me sing a lullaby, love (让我唱首摇篮曲吧，亲爱的)
[03:06.84] I'll be seeing you, baby (再见，宝贝)